# Revised Implementation Plan: ORCA MVP (Marine Ecosystem Reasoning with Collaborative Agents)

This is the revised, focused architecture and implementation plan for the **ORCA MVP**. It prioritizes a single, complete, end-to-end **killer workflow**, strictly uses verified unauthenticated live data endpoints, and maintains transparent data provenance (`LIVE`, `DEMO`, `UNAVAILABLE`).

---

## 1. Data Source & Dependency Matrix (LIVE vs. DEMO vs. CREDENTIALS)

To ensure zero ambiguity and avoid any simulated data masquerading as live telemetry, here is the exact classification of every component in the MVP:

| Component | Source / Protocol | Access Mode | Status Classification | Verified Endpoint / Notes |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Ocean Waves, Swell, SST & Currents** | Open-Meteo Marine API | Public, Unauthenticated | **`LIVE`** | `https://marine-api.open-meteo.com/v1/marine`<br>Hourly: `wave_height`, `wave_direction`, `wave_period`, `wind_wave_height`, `swell_wave_height`, `ocean_current_velocity`, `ocean_current_direction`, `sea_surface_temperature`. |
| **Wind, Gusts, Pressure & Weather** | Open-Meteo Forecast API | Public, Unauthenticated | **`LIVE`** | `https://api.open-meteo.com/v1/forecast`<br>Hourly & Current: `wind_speed_10m`, `wind_direction_10m`, `wind_gusts_10m`, `precipitation`, `surface_pressure`, `weather_code`. |
| **Geospatial Reference (Ports & MPAs)** | Local GeoJSON Reference Assets | Offline Bundled Asset | **`REFERENCE / STATIC`** | Curated official coordinates for major Indian coastal ports and Marine Protected Areas (MPAs). |
| **Potential Fishing Zones (PFZ)** | `IncoisPfzProvider` | Modular Interface | **`DEMO`** (Default) / **`LIVE`** (Optional) | INCOIS does not publish a free, unauthenticated public REST API for live JSON feeds. The provider defaults to an authentic, clearly labelled **`DEMO`** advisory sample dataset unless an authenticated proxy/feed is configured in environment variables. |
| **AI Language Model (Planner & Synthesizer)** | Google Gemini API (`@google/genai` or Vercel AI SDK) | API Key in `.env.local` | **`DEPENDENT ON CREDENTIAL`** (Server-side only) | `GEMINI_API_KEY` configured in server environment variables. Never exposed to browser. |
| **Decision-Support Engine** | ORCA Deterministic Safety Rules | TypeScript Core Engine | **`DETERMINISTIC LOGIC`** | **Prototype decision-support model based on documented meteorological/ocean criteria**. (No claim of official IMD/WMO government certification). |

