## 2. The Primary Killer Workflow

**Target User Query:** *"Is it safe to venture into the sea tomorrow morning from my selected location?"*

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User / Fisherman
    participant UI as Interactive Marine UI (Map + Chat)
    participant Orchestrator as Planner Agent (/api/chat)
    participant WeatherAgent as Weather Agent
    participant OceanAgent as Ocean Agent
    participant GeoAgent as Geospatial Agent
    participant RiskEngine as Deterministic Risk Engine
    participant LLM as Explanatory Synthesizer

    User->>UI: Selects location on map + asks safety query for tomorrow morning
    UI->>Orchestrator: POST { coordinates: { lat, lon }, timeWindow: "tomorrow_morning", query: "..." }
    
    par Multi-Agent Parallel Gathering
        Orchestrator->>WeatherAgent: Fetch forecast (wind, gusts, precipitation, pressure)
        WeatherAgent->>OpenMeteoWeather: GET /v1/forecast (Verified Live API)
        OpenMeteoWeather-->>WeatherAgent: Hourly forecast data
        WeatherAgent-->>Orchestrator: WeatherObservation (LIVE)
    and
        Orchestrator->>OceanAgent: Fetch marine state (waves, swell, SST, currents)
        OceanAgent->>OpenMeteoMarine: GET /v1/marine (Verified Live API)
        OpenMeteoMarine-->>OceanAgent: Hourly marine data
        OceanAgent-->>Orchestrator: OceanObservation (LIVE)
    and
        Orchestrator->>GeoAgent: Check distance to nearest port & MPA geofences
        GeoAgent-->>Orchestrator: GeospatialAssessment (REFERENCE)
    end

    Orchestrator->>RiskEngine: Evaluate combined telemetry (Weather + Ocean + Geospatial)
    Note over RiskEngine: Pure TypeScript computation:<br/>Beaufort scale, wave hazard tiers,<br/>gust risk, distance to shelter
    RiskEngine-->>Orchestrator: RiskAssessment { level: "CAUTION", score: 62, primaryHazards: [...], rulesTriggered: [...] }

    Orchestrator->>LLM: Synthesize explanation using verified facts + RiskAssessment
    Note over LLM: Grounded in evidence only.<br/>Cannot alter risk rating.
    LLM-->>Orchestrator: Natural language advice with actionable guidance

    Orchestrator-->>UI: { answer, riskAssessment, rawEvidence, statusBadges, visualCoordinates }
    UI->>UI: Render response, Evidence Card (sources/timestamps), and update Map layer
```

