## 5. Technical Stack

- **Framework**: Next.js 14/15 (App Router, TypeScript, React 18/19)
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS + Lucide Icons (Dark tactical marine theme)
- **Geospatial / Mapping**: Leaflet & React-Leaflet (Ocean basemap, vector markers, distance measurement, geofence polygons)
- **Spatial Computations**: Turf.js (`@turf/turf`)
- **AI Orchestration**: Google Gemini API via `@google/genai` (Server-side tool calling and structured response synthesis)

